<view class="screen">
  <view class="brand">
    <text>ONEIRO</text>
    <text>DREAM</text>
  </view>

  <text class="eyebrow">Dream Memory</text>
  <text class="title">记下刚才的梦</text>
  <view class="copy">
    <text>一个画面、一句话或一种情绪也足够。原文会先保存，解读失败也不会丢失。</text>
  </view>

  <textarea
    class="dream-input"
    value="{{dreamText}}"
    maxlength="1200"
    auto-height="{{false}}"
    bindinput="onDreamInput"
    placeholder="例如：我在月光下的图书馆里，捡到一把银色钥匙..."
    placeholder-class="muted"
  />

  <button
    class="{{recording ? 'voice-button recording' : 'voice-button'}}"
    bindtap="toggleRecording"
    disabled="{{recognizing}}"
  >
    {{recording ? '停止 · ' + recordingSeconds + 's' : '🎙 语音记梦'}}
  </button>
  <text wx:if="{{recognizing}}" class="recognizing-note">正在识别…</text>

  <button class="ghost-button" bindtap="useSample">试一个示例梦</button>
  <button class="primary-button" bindtap="generateDreamCard">保存并解读</button>
  <text class="privacy-note">出生信息完全自愿填写；填写后解读会增加一个“出生节律”视角，也可随时清空。原梦和解读默认仅自己可见，分享时只包含去隐私的梦卡。</text>
</view>
